  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help fight Japa trend among youths in Nigeria now</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigerian youths desire prosperity. the high cost of living &amp; low standard of living,  weak economy, social distress, underemployment, poverty, hunger and mounting insecurity are the causes of &apos;japa&apos; of the Nigerian youths. Mass migration has lots of debilitating effects on the economy and on various aspects of a country&apos;s life. Nigeria&apos;s large population should be a blessing. The contest of strength is not only a contest of military and economic power but also a contest of human power &amp; morale.</narrative>
  </description>
